      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Hello! This is Asha calling from Swasth Family Clinic about an upcoming appointment. Before I share any details, may I please confirm your full name and date of birth?"
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "speaking. Arjun Mehta, 4th of June 1978."
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you, Arjun, that matches our records. I'm calling to remind you of your appointment with Dr. Rao this Thursday at 4 PM."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "I already cancelled this appointment last week, why are you calling me again?"
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "I'm so sorry for the confusion, Arjun. May I ask when you cancelled it? I'll make sure our records are reconciled."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "text": "I called on Tuesday and the receptionist confirmed it. this is really annoying."
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "I completely understand, and I apologize for the repeated call. I've noted your Tuesday cancellation and the record will be corrected. Thank you for your patience, and have a good day."
    }
  ]
}

